case 1: the record only, before the swap
a: x
b: x,y

case 2: after the first move
a: x,y
b: x

case 3: after the second move
a: x,y
b: x

case 4: after the third move
a: x,y
b: x

case 5: a leftover temporary record and a leftover write of a finish
a: x
b: x,y

case 6: the record only, and a metadata file that changed after it
a: x,z
b: x,y

case 7: the temporary file, and a metadata file with neither of the recorded contents
CORRUPTED_DATA
.a.sql.exchange
the temporary file is untouched
a.sql is untouched
b.sql is untouched
a: x
b: x,y

case 8: a temporary file with neither of the recorded contents, after the first move
CORRUPTED_DATA
.a.sql.exchange
the temporary file is untouched
b.sql is untouched
a.sql is missing
a: x
b: x,y

case 9: the temporary file without a record
no valid exchange record is next to it
INCORRECT_FILE_NAME
the temporary file is left

case 10: a record whose path is not the record path of its old path
no valid exchange record is next to it
INCORRECT_FILE_NAME
.a.sql.exchange
a.sql is untouched
b.sql is untouched
a: x
b: x,y
